+    increasing retraction/extension, and reverse-order variants on level
+    3 -- none advanced past level 2. Level 3 presents four vertically
+    linked colors against a separate horizontal head-to-tail ordering
+    strip. Reproduction gate passed for level 2. No new level banked;
+    frontier stays at level 2.'
